      "title": "Black Friday Week deals: AirPods Max 2 $130 off, AirPods Pro 3, M5 MacBook Air $1,049, iPhone Air up to $799 off, more",
      "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/11/Apple-Black-Friday-Week-deals.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We have now made our way into Day 2 of the <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0f5M9hKp\">massive Amazon Black Friday sale</a> with all-time lows on Apple Watch Series 12, <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0fvR7vL0\">AirPods Pro 3 at <strong>$70 off</strong></a>, <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B064g1rap\">MacBook Neo from <strong>$649</strong></a>, and a fantastic price drop on the most affordable <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B0iVOclbN\">M5 MacBook Air at <strong>$1,049</strong></a>. However, Amazon has now dropped the price even lower on <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B01Hntsu2\">AirPods Max 2 at <strong>$130 off</strong></a>, we have<strong> </strong><a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/20/iphone-air-new-unlocked-black-friday-deals/\">iPhone Air new unlocked at nearly $300 off</a> for Black Friday (or Best Buy open-box units up to a <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/20/iphone-air-new-unlocked-black-friday-deals/\">massive $799 off</a>), and loads of deals on Beats headphones and buds at up to <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/20/official-beats-black-friday-deals-live-360/\"><strong>53% off</strong></a> the list prices (the new 360 are now <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B07QDUIXP\"><strong>$100 off</strong></a>). Those deals join the ongoing all-time lows on <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B03BMD6A3\">M6 MacBook Pro</a> at $150 off, <a href=\"https://link.amazon/B02pebXFc\">Apple Studio Displays at <strong>$200 off</strong></a>, and a brilliant deal on the <a href=\"https://9to5toys.com/2026/11/19/twelve-south-airfly-drive-wireless-carplay-android-auto-adapter-black-friday/\">Twelve South AirFly Drive Wireless CarPlay Adapter at $32</a>. Check it all out below. </p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"9to5toys,9to5t